=== Day3 ===
It's weird...
Having to clean the place that cleans me.
Am I using a tool?
Am I the my tool?
A cleaning tool.
A cleaning tool that gets dirty.
And I clean the dirty tool with a tool that gets dirty.
So I clean it.
And it gets dirtier.
And dirtier.
And dirtier.
And dirtier.
And dirtier.
And dirtier.
And dirtier.
And dirtier.
So I clean it.
So it cleans me.
And we get dirty again.
...
I don't want to get dirty again.

